  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/1520743_630833640340957_4946658417479020526_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Este viernes ha finalizado la primera &#39;fun week&#39; del verano en Kids&amp;Us Onda School of english, que las albergar&aacute; durante todo el mes de julio en el centro de la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9. Ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as de 1 a 10 a&ntilde;os pueden disfrutar tambi&eacute;n del market, el twister o de actividades en el jard&iacute;n.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampusonda030714/img_8562.jpg\" alt=\"img_8562\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampusonda030714/img_8563.jpg\" alt=\"img_8563\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampusonda030714/img_8566.jpg\" alt=\"img_8566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampusonda030714/img_8569.jpg\" alt=\"img_8569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampusonda030714/img_8570.jpg\" alt=\"img_8570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampusonda030714/img_8571.jpg\" alt=\"img_8571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampusonda030714/img_8572.jpg\" alt=\"img_8572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/funweekestiukidsampuson